  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher refiner run rates (stronger downstream margins and utilisation) improve project economics and attract cross‑border downstream investment and M&amp;A (including Sino‑US deals or divestments), raising bilateral capital and investment flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
